Validation

AICL development includes testing and benchmarking.

The validation process examines areas such as:

- semantic preservation
- context preservation
- content preservation
- identifier uniqueness
- collision detection
- conflict detection
- parsing
- token efficiency
- character efficiency
- failure rate

