Contributing

If you find an ambiguous rule, an unsupported case, a conflict, or another issue while using AICL, open an Issue or Discussion.

Changes to the frozen V6 specification should be proposed separately rather than modifying the reference directly.

Proposed changes can be reviewed for a future version.

